WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:01.168
We're a family.

00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:04.338
Me, a boy,

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.381
and his mom,
who is usually great,

00:00:06.465 --> 00:00:08.717
but occasionally murders
people with her bare hands.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.469
What could go wrong?

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.892
Don't get me wrong.

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.810
This isn't some
German fairy tale

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:20.479
where a witch keeps me
locked up

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.564
till it's time to eat me.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:24.107
Love is nice,

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:25.317
giving.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.735
I wolf you.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:29.988
I fell in love with
a certain version of her.

00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:30.989
We…

00:00:33.075 --> 00:00:33.992
both…

00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:36.662
have done bad things.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.919
I wanted to move here
so that we could start new,

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:46.380
be safe,

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.340
and never have to do
anything bad ever again.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.758
We get to choose.

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:51.677
We get to choose.
We are safe now.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:53.345
We're together.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:55.347
I promise, no more.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.350
No more bad things.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:00.519
So what brings you in?

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.980
We had a fight.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:05.023
Love, I told you,
nothing happened.

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:07.150
If anything,
she came on to me.

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:08.402
You kept a box, Joe.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:10.070
I know what that means.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.613
I know you.

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:13.782
Why don't you
love me anymore?

00:01:13.866 --> 00:01:15.492
You know why,
you just won't say it.

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:17.119
I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:19.121
You had a fucking hook
to my throat.

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:20.497
And then,
I said I was pregnant,

00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:22.708
and then, we just

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.293
went on and pretended
like it didn't happen.

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:26.044
No, no! No, we didn't!
No, we didn't.

00:01:30.591 --> 00:01:32.593
Is there something else
you're not telling me?

00:01:33.719 --> 00:01:35.470
OK. He… He kissed me.

00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:36.847
-He kissed you?
-Yeah.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.849
It was before
he left for school.

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:41.059
I mean, obviously,
I shut it down.

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:42.978
-That's shutting it down?
-Don't yell at me.

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:44.354
You have been
sneaking around.

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:45.731
Sneaking around?
That's crazy.

00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:47.191
You made me feel

00:01:47.274 --> 00:01:48.692
like there's something
wrong with me,

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:49.943
and I've done everything
you asked

00:01:50.027 --> 00:01:52.571
when you've been lying to me
this whole time.

00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:55.657
Right now, my game
is being a good husband.

00:01:55.741 --> 00:01:57.242
No, no.

00:01:57.326 --> 00:01:58.702
No, the best husband,

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.412
so Love doesn't
get suspicious

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:02.122
about what's
really going on:

00:02:02.206 --> 00:02:05.709
that I can't stop
thinking about you,

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.752
Marienne.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:09.796
My wife needs to feel
like mildly transgressing

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.715
with that idiot rich kid
did the trick.

00:02:17.221 --> 00:02:19.681
She's not a boring,
tired suburban mom.

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:25.646
She's fun, wild,

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:28.148
still the Love Quinn
who flirts with strangers

00:02:28.232 --> 00:02:29.525
in the produce section.

00:02:35.322 --> 00:02:37.366
What, you act like I…
I'm not all in.

00:02:37.449 --> 00:02:38.492
I am right here.

00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:41.245
All I do is worry about you.

00:02:41.328 --> 00:02:42.996
I don't need you
to worry about me.

00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:46.124
I need your heart.

00:02:46.792 --> 00:02:49.378
-Henry needs your heart.
-Leave Henry out of this.

00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:50.796
I can't, Joe.

00:02:51.964 --> 00:02:54.216
Unlike you,
I have to be his mother,

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:55.259
24-7,

00:02:55.884 --> 00:02:58.095
in addition to running
a fucking business,

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:01.431
keeping this house together,
dragging you to therapy,

00:03:01.515 --> 00:03:03.058
trying to be my sexiest self

00:03:03.141 --> 00:03:05.060
so you don't get bored
and find another Natalie.

00:03:05.143 --> 00:03:06.603
Can you please
lower your voice?

00:03:06.687 --> 00:03:08.230
Why?
You hate hearing the truth?

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:10.983
Our marriage
is completely one-sided.

00:03:11.066 --> 00:03:12.609
That is absurd.

00:03:12.693 --> 00:03:14.403
You made me kill her.

00:03:14.486 --> 00:03:16.905
In addition to being mother
of the fucking year,

00:03:16.989 --> 00:03:17.823
I had to run interference

00:03:17.906 --> 00:03:19.366
on one of your
fucking patterns.

00:03:19.449 --> 00:03:21.535
-I killed Natalie for you!
-Shut up!

00:03:24.288 --> 00:03:25.956
Did you ever
actually love me?

00:03:27.249 --> 00:03:28.584
From the moment I saw you.

00:03:31.378 --> 00:03:32.588
You know this. I would do--

00:03:32.671 --> 00:03:34.298
I know
that you cheated on me.

00:03:34.798 --> 00:03:36.800
-And you lied.
-Okay. Can… Can we?

00:03:36.884 --> 00:03:39.636
You made me feel
like you really saw me.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:40.596
Yeah, he's just a kid

00:03:40.679 --> 00:03:42.389
who you were having
an affair with.

00:03:44.183 --> 00:03:46.185
We can do this
if you are willing to admit,

00:03:46.268 --> 00:03:47.936
you have not been
perfectly happy either.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.521
We have both

00:03:50.355 --> 00:03:51.398
made mistakes.

00:03:51.481 --> 00:03:53.817
I tried, and I know that
you have been trying too,

00:03:54.776 --> 00:03:56.570
but it didn't work.

00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:58.906
And now, we can be honest

00:03:59.823 --> 00:04:00.908
about that

00:04:01.491 --> 00:04:03.493
and deal with this
like two adults.

00:04:04.369 --> 00:04:05.370
Meaning what?

00:04:05.454 --> 00:04:07.206
Meaning we don't have
to do anything impulsive.

00:04:07.289 --> 00:04:08.123
What does that mean?

00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:10.459
James.

00:04:10.542 --> 00:04:12.920
James, what you did to him…

00:04:13.545 --> 00:04:14.546
I did.

00:04:15.422 --> 00:04:17.674
I did kill him,
but I didn't mean to.

00:04:21.303 --> 00:04:23.889
It was my first time
using it, and…

00:04:25.307 --> 00:04:28.101
the dosage was too high
when ingested.

00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:33.690
This time, I'm letting it
absorb through the skin.

00:04:34.358 --> 00:04:35.400
None of this
would be happening

00:04:35.484 --> 00:04:36.818
if you hadn't grabbed
a weapon.

00:04:38.695 --> 00:04:42.199
No one will ever love you
like I do, Joe.

00:04:50.207 --> 00:04:51.208
But that…

00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:53.377
that little voice
in the back of my head

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:55.629
that I've been suppressing
this whole fucking time,

00:04:55.712 --> 00:04:56.713
it was right.

00:05:02.594 --> 00:05:03.595
I'm not the problem.

00:05:05.764 --> 00:05:07.349
My husband is the problem.

00:05:17.901 --> 00:05:19.611
Aconite, when
injected directly, burns

00:05:19.695 --> 00:05:22.573
as it moves through
the system to the heart.

00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:24.783
Think less slow paralysis,

00:05:24.867 --> 00:05:27.911
more total fucking agony.

00:05:27.995 --> 00:05:29.872
I'm sorry
it had to come to this.

00:05:29.955 --> 00:05:31.832
Did you really think

00:05:31.915 --> 00:05:33.500
that I wouldn't start
to wonder…

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.088
what you were growing
in the garden?

00:05:42.843 --> 00:05:45.053
Wolfsbane, a paralytic.

00:05:45.804 --> 00:05:47.764
-No.
-It's slows the heart.

00:05:47.848 --> 00:05:50.142
So, I Googled antidotes.

00:05:50.225 --> 00:05:52.728
Turns out, I needed
biohacking. Adrenaline.

00:05:52.811 --> 00:05:54.563
And who doesn't have that
around here, right?

00:05:55.522 --> 00:05:58.192
A little voice in my head
told me to take it…

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:01.528
before you played your hand.

00:06:09.036 --> 00:06:09.953
Joe…

00:06:11.788 --> 00:06:13.123
You did this to yourself.

00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:18.587
And the hardest part
was making the dose,

00:06:19.588 --> 00:06:21.423
because I couldn't lie
to myself.

00:06:22.966 --> 00:06:24.593
It had to be enough.

00:06:25.928 --> 00:06:27.930
I had to finally stop you.

00:06:29.473 --> 00:06:32.142
We're perfect
for each other…

00:06:34.686 --> 00:06:36.146
but bad…

00:06:37.356 --> 00:06:38.607
for Henry.

00:06:41.068 --> 00:06:42.319
He'll know

00:06:43.362 --> 00:06:45.447
what you are.

